{"suttaId":"tha-ap174","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[6865,6877],"vripara":"9"},"segments":{"tha-ap174:0.3":"Nisseṇidāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap174:1.1":"“Koṇḍaññassa bhagavato, lokajeṭṭhassa tādino;","tha-ap174:1.3":"Ārohatthāya pāsādaṃ, nisseṇī kāritā mayā.","tha-ap174:2.1":"“Tena cittappasādena, anubhotvāna sampadā;","tha-ap174:2.3":"Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane.","tha-ap174:3.1":"“Ekattiṃsamhi kappānaṃ, sahassamhi tayo ahuṃ [mahā (sī. syā.)];","tha-ap174:3.3":"Sambahulā nāma rājāno, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap174:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap174:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā nisseṇidāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap174:6.1":"Nisseṇidāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3126,"to":3126,"paras":[{"para":3126,"vripara":"9","refs":["tha-ap174:1"],"words":["koṇḍaññassa bhagavato","koṇḍaññassā"],"lines":["So attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>koṇḍaññassa bhagavato</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>koṇḍaññassā</b>ti kucchito hutvā ḍeti pavattatīti koṇḍo, lāmakasatto, koṇḍato aññoti koṇḍañño, alāmako uttamapurisoti attho.","Atha vā brāhmaṇagottesu koṇḍaññagotte uppannattā “koṇḍañño”ti gottavasena tassa nāmaṃ, tassa koṇḍaññassa.","Sesaṃ pākaṭamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap174:1"],["tha-ap174:1"],["tha-ap174:1"],["tha-ap174:1"]]}]},"tika":null}
